{"seq":1,"slug":"optical-astronomy","title":"光学天文学：可见光与近红外观测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/observational-astronomy/electromagnetic-spectrum/optical-astronomy","wordCount":2602,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"光学天文学-可见光与近红外观测\">光学天文学：可见光与近红外观测</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>光学天文学是人类最古老也最直观的天文观测方式，以可见光（380–700 nm）和近红外（700 nm–2.5 μm）波段为工作窗口。地球大气在这一波段具有较高的透明度，使得地面望远镜能够直接接收来自宇宙的光子信号。从恒星的热辐射到遥远星系的红移光谱，光学观测提供了天文学最丰富、最精细的信息来源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>光学天文学的观测能力由三个相互耦合的基本量刻画：<strong>可用波段</strong>（由天体辐射谱与大气透射窗共同决定）、<strong>灵敏度</strong>（受天空背景与探测器噪声限制的极限星等）、<strong>分辨率</strong>（衍射极限与大气视宁度竞争的结果）。所有后续技术选择——探测器、观测模式、设施设计——都是在这三个量之间做权衡。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>基本量</th>\n<th>物理来源</th>\n<th>定量关系</th>\n<th>约束因素</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>辐射峰值</td>\n<td>恒星黑体辐射（Wien 位移律）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_{\\max} = b/T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>决定最适配观测波段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>探测灵敏度</td>\n<td>源/背景/噪声的光子统计</td>\n<td>SNR 随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{N_s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.1883em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8517em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8117em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1883em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 增长</td>\n<td>天空背景、读出噪声</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>角分辨率</td>\n<td>口径衍射极限</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>1.22</mn><mi>λ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta \\approx 1.22\\lambda/D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.22</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>地面受大气视宁度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集光能力</td>\n<td>有效集光面积与曝光时间</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∝</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mtext>eff</mtext></msub><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\propto A_{\\text{eff}} t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">eff</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>口径与仪器效率</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"物理基础\">物理基础</h2><h3 id=\"黑体辐射与恒星光谱\">黑体辐射与恒星光谱</h3><p>恒星表面近似为黑体辐射体，其辐射峰值波长由 Wien 位移定律决定：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>b</mi><mi>T</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_{\\max} = \\frac{b}{T}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2.898</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b = 2.898 \\times 10^{-3}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.898</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> m·K。太阳表面温度约 5778 K，辐射峰值在 501 nm（绿色波段），这解释了为何可见光窗口恰好覆盖了主序星辐射的能量峰值区域。</p>\n<h3 id=\"大气透明窗口\">大气透明窗口</h3><p>地球大气对电磁辐射的透射率呈波长依赖性。光学窗口（约 300–1100 nm）的高透射率源于大气主要成分（N₂、O₂）在该波段缺乏强电子跃迁吸收带。近红外窗口则被水汽和 CO₂ 分子的振转吸收带分割为多个子窗口（J、H、K、L、M 波段）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>波段</th>\n<th>中心波长 (μm)</th>\n<th>带宽 (μm)</th>\n<th>主要吸收源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>U</td>\n<td>0.36</td>\n<td>0.07</td>\n<td>O₃ 吸收截止</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>B</td>\n<td>0.44</td>\n<td>0.10</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>V</td>\n<td>0.55</td>\n<td>0.09</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>R</td>\n<td>0.64</td>\n<td>0.15</td>\n<td>O₂ A-band</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>I</td>\n<td>0.80</td>\n<td>0.15</td>\n<td>H₂O</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>J</td>\n<td>1.25</td>\n<td>0.30</td>\n<td>H₂O</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>H</td>\n<td>1.65</td>\n<td>0.35</td>\n<td>H₂O, CO₂</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>K</td>\n<td>2.20</td>\n<td>0.40</td>\n<td>H₂O, CO₂</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"天空背景与极限星等\">天空背景与极限星等</h3><p>地面光学观测的灵敏度受天空背景亮度限制。暗夜天空背景主要来源包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>大气辉光</strong>（airglow）：高层大气分子的化学发光，V 波段约 21.5–22.0 mag/arcsec²</li>\n<li><strong>黄道光</strong>：行星际尘埃散射太阳光</li>\n<li><strong>银河弥散光</strong>：银河系恒星和星际介质的积分贡献</li>\n<li><strong>人工光污染</strong>：城市照明散射</li>\n</ul>\n<p>信噪比决定探测极限：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>SNR</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><msqrt><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>pix</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>N</mi><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msqrt></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{SNR} = \\frac{N_s}{\\sqrt{N_s + n_{\\text{pix}}(N_b + N_d + N_r^2)}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SNR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4903em;vertical-align:-1.13em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.1931em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9169em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pix</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8769em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.28em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.28em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1296\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M263,681c0.7,0,18,39.7,52,119\nc34,79.3,68.167,158.7,102.5,238c34.3,79.3,51.8,119.3,52.5,120\nc340,-704.7,510.7,-1060.3,512,-1067\nl0 -0\nc4.7,-7.3,11,-11,19,-11\nH40000v40H1012.3\ns-271.3,567,-271.3,567c-38.7,80.7,-84,175,-136,283c-52,108,-89.167,185.3,-111.5,232\nc-22.3,46.7,-33.8,70.3,-34.5,71c-4.7,4.7,-12.3,7,-23,7s-12,-1,-12,-1\ns-109,-253,-109,-253c-72.7,-168,-109.3,-252,-110,-252c-10.7,8,-22,16.7,-34,26\nc-22,17.3,-33.3,26,-34,26s-26,-26,-26,-26s76,-59,76,-59s76,-60,76,-60z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3231em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.13em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为源光子数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>b</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为背景，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为暗电流，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为读出噪声，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>pix</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{\\text{pix}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pix</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为提取孔径内像素数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"探测器技术\">探测器技术</h2><h3 id=\"从照相底片到-ccd\">从照相底片到 CCD</h3><p>天文探测器经历了从肉眼→照相底片→光电倍增管→CCD→CMOS 的演进。CCD（电荷耦合器件）自 1970 年代引入天文观测以来，以其高量子效率（QE &gt; 90%）、线性响应和低噪声彻底革新了光学天文学。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[入射光子] --&gt; B[硅片光电转换]&#10;    B --&gt; C[电荷积累]&#10;    C --&gt; D[行间转移]&#10;    D --&gt; E[串行读出]&#10;    E --&gt; F[ADC数字化]&#10;    F --&gt; G[图像数据]\">flowchart LR\n    A[入射光子] --&gt; B[硅片光电转换]\n    B --&gt; C[电荷积累]\n    C --&gt; D[行间转移]\n    D --&gt; E[串行读出]\n    E --&gt; F[ADC数字化]\n    F --&gt; G[图像数据]</pre><h3 id=\"现代科学级-cmos\">现代科学级 CMOS</h3><p>2020 年代，背照式科学级 CMOS（sCMOS）传感器在多个关键指标上追赶甚至超越 CCD：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>科学级 CCD</th>\n<th>科学级 CMOS</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>量子效率（峰值）</td>\n<td>&gt;95%</td>\n<td>&gt;95%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>读出噪声</td>\n<td>2–5 e⁻</td>\n<td>1–3 e⁻</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>读出速度</td>\n<td>~1 Mpix/s</td>\n<td>&gt;100 Mpix/s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全帧容量</td>\n<td>~100 ke⁻</td>\n<td>~80 ke⁻</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>非线性度</td>\n<td>&lt;0.1%</td>\n<td>&lt;0.5%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>辉光效应</td>\n<td>存在</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Vera C. Rubin 天文台的 LSST 相机采用 3.2 吉像素 CCD 焦面阵列，是目前投入运行的最大天文成像探测器，其 189 个 CCD 传感器覆盖 9.6 平方度视场。</p>\n<h2 id=\"观测模式\">观测模式</h2><h3 id=\"成像观测\">成像观测</h3><p>成像观测通过宽带或窄带滤光片获取天体的空间亮度分布。现代全景巡天在多波段系统下工作，典型如 SDSS 的 ugriz 五色系统和 LSST 的 ugrizy 六色系统。多色测光不仅提供恒星分类和红移估计（测光红移），还能通过颜色-颜色图分离不同天体类型。</p>\n<h3 id=\"光谱观测\">光谱观测</h3><p>光谱观测将入射光按波长色散，获取目标的一维或二维光谱信息。根据色散机制分为：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>棱镜光谱仪</strong>：色散率随波长非线性变化，适用于低分辨率巡天</li>\n<li><strong>光栅光谱仪</strong>：通过衍射光栅实现线性色散，分辨率 R = λ/Δλ 可从数百到数十万</li>\n<li><strong>回声梯光栅</strong>：高阶衍射结合交叉色散，实现高分辨率宽波段覆盖</li>\n<li><strong>积分场光谱仪</strong>（IFU）：同时获取视场内每个空间元的完整光谱</li>\n</ul>\n<p>光谱分辨率的选择取决于科学目标：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分辨率范围</th>\n<th>R 值</th>\n<th>典型应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>低分辨率</td>\n<td>100–1000</td>\n<td>红移测量、天体分类</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中分辨率</td>\n<td>1000–10000</td>\n<td>恒星参数、星际介质</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高分辨率</td>\n<td>10000–100000</td>\n<td>化学丰度、径向速度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超高分辨率</td>\n<td>&gt;100000</td>\n<td>系外行星大气、同位素比</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"代表性设施\">代表性设施</h2><h3 id=\"地面大型光学望远镜\">地面大型光学望远镜</h3><p>当代地面光学望远镜以 8–10 米级为主力：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>VLT（甚大望远镜）</strong>：4 × 8.2 m，ESO Cerro Paranal，可组合干涉（VLTI）</li>\n<li><strong>Keck I/II</strong>：2 × 10 m 分段镜面，Mauna Kea</li>\n<li><strong>Subaru</strong>：8.2 m 单镜面，超广角主焦相机 HSC</li>\n<li><strong>GTC（加那利大望远镜）</strong>：10.4 m，目前最大光学红外望远镜</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"在建下一代极大望远镜\">在建下一代极大望远镜</h3><p>2020 年代同时有三台 25–39 米级望远镜在建，将于 2020 年代末至 2030 年代初投入使用：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>望远镜</th>\n<th>口径</th>\n<th>集光面积</th>\n<th>选址</th>\n<th>预计首光</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ELT（欧洲极大望远镜）</td>\n<td>39.3 m</td>\n<td>978 m²</td>\n<td>Cerro Armazones, 智利</td>\n<td>~2028</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TMT（三十米望远镜）</td>\n<td>30 m</td>\n<td>655 m²</td>\n<td>Mauna Kea / La Palma</td>\n<td>待定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GMT（巨型麦哲伦望远镜）</td>\n<td>24.5 m</td>\n<td>368 m²</td>\n<td>Las Campanas, 智利</td>\n<td>~2029</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这些望远镜配合自适应光学，将在近红外波段实现比 JWST 更高的角分辨率，在系外行星直接成像、早期宇宙星系和恒星物理等领域带来突破。</p>\n<h2 id=\"jwst-与空间光学观测\">JWST 与空间光学观测</h2><p>James Webb 空间望远镜（JWST）于 2021 年 12 月发射，配备 6.5 米分段金镀铍主镜，工作于日-地 L2 拉格朗日点。其四台科学仪器覆盖 0.6–28.3 μm 波段：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>NIRCam</strong>：近红外相机，0.6–5 μm，主成像仪器</li>\n<li><strong>NIRSpec</strong>：近红外光谱仪，0.6–5.3 μm，含微快门阵列（MSA）多目标光谱</li>\n<li><strong>MIRI</strong>：中红外仪器，5–28.3 μm，成像与光谱</li>\n<li><strong>FGS/NIRISS</strong>：精确导星与无缝棱镜光谱</li>\n</ul>\n<p>JWST 在运行三年多来已产出大量突破性发现，包括宇宙黎明时期（z &gt; 10）的早期星系、系外行星大气的详细光谱特征（包括 WASP-39b 大气中 CO₂ 的首次明确探测），以及恒星形成区的前所未有的高分辨率红外图像。</p>\n<h2 id=\"大规模巡天与数据驱动天文学\">大规模巡天与数据驱动天文学</h2><h3 id=\"巡天范式的演进\">巡天范式的演进</h3><p>现代光学天文学正经历从&quot;指向观测&quot;到&quot;巡天科学&quot;的范式转变。大规模巡天产生的均匀、高质量数据集，使统计天文学和数据挖掘成为与传统观测同等重要的研究模式。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    A[SDSS 2000-2014] --&gt; B[DES 2013-2019]&#10;    B --&gt; C[HSC-SSP 2014-2025]&#10;    C --&gt; D[LSST/Rubin 2025+]&#10;    D --&gt; E[每晚 20 TB 数据]&#10;    D --&gt; F[10 年 ~800 次全天覆盖]&#10;    D --&gt; G[~200 亿天体目录]\">flowchart TB\n    A[SDSS 2000-2014] --&gt; B[DES 2013-2019]\n    B --&gt; C[HSC-SSP 2014-2025]\n    C --&gt; D[LSST/Rubin 2025+]\n    D --&gt; E[每晚 20 TB 数据]\n    D --&gt; F[10 年 ~800 次全天覆盖]\n    D --&gt; G[~200 亿天体目录]</pre><h3 id=\"vera-c-rubin-天文台与-lsst\">Vera C. Rubin 天文台与 LSST</h3><p>Vera C. Rubin 天文台（前身为 LSST 项目）位于智利 Cerro Pachón，配备 8.4 米主镜和 3.2 吉像素相机。其 Legacy Survey of Space and Time（LSST）将在 10 年内以 3–4 天的节奏覆盖整个南半球天空，单次曝光 r 波段达 ~24.5 等，叠加后达 ~27.5 等。</p>\n<p>2025 年，Rubin 天文台完成了 LSSTComCam 的首次天空调试观测，获取了约 15 平方度天区的 Data Preview 1 数据集。2026 年 2 月 24 日，天文台发布了首批 80 万条科学警报，内容涵盖超新星、变星、活动星系核和小行星，标志着时域巡天系统正式投入科学运行。在早期优化巡天阶段，仅一个半月的数据即确认了超过 11,000 颗此前未知的小行星，展示了该设施在太阳系科学中的巨大潜力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前沿方向\">前沿方向</h2><p>光学天文学的未来发展方向包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>极高对比度成像</strong>：日冕仪与波前传感的协同优化，目标直接拍摄类地系外行星</li>\n<li><strong>光子计数探测器</strong>：超导纳米线单光子探测器（SNSPD）在天文中的应用探索</li>\n<li><strong>AI 辅助观测</strong>：实时数据分析、自动调度和异常源识别</li>\n<li><strong>光学干涉测量</strong>：GRAVITY+ 等设施将光学干涉灵敏度提升数量级，实现 z~4 类星体的直接分辨</li>\n</ul>\n<p>光学天文学正从传统的&quot;收集光子&quot;向&quot;智能观测&quot;演进，数据洪流和人工智能的结合正在重新定义天文发现的模式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>光学窗口（约 300–1100 nm）源自大气主要成分缺乏强吸收带；近红外被水汽和 CO₂ 分割为多个子窗。</li>\n<li>地面光学观测的灵敏度根本上受天空背景（大气辉光、黄道光、光污染）限制，而非仅由望远镜口径决定。</li>\n<li>探测器从照相底片经 CCD 演进到科学级 CMOS，读出速度与噪声持续改善，使大规模巡天成为可能。</li>\n<li>观测模式分为成像（多波段测光）与光谱（色散获取物理参数），光谱分辨率的选择取决于科学目标。</li>\n<li>8–10 米级望远镜是当代主力，25–39 米的 ELT/GMT/TMT 将在 2020 年代末投入运行，配合自适应光学超越 JWST 的近红外分辨率。</li>\n<li>天文学正从&quot;指向观测&quot;转向&quot;巡天科学&quot;，Rubin/LSST 每晚 20 TB 的数据流使统计与数据挖掘成为核心研究模式。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"光学天文学：可见光与近红外观测","id":"光学天文学-可见光与近红外观测"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"物理基础","id":"物理基础"},{"level":3,"text":"黑体辐射与恒星光谱","id":"黑体辐射与恒星光谱"},{"level":3,"text":"大气透明窗口","id":"大气透明窗口"},{"level":3,"text":"天空背景与极限星等","id":"天空背景与极限星等"},{"level":2,"text":"探测器技术","id":"探测器技术"},{"level":3,"text":"从照相底片到 CCD","id":"从照相底片到-ccd"},{"level":3,"text":"现代科学级 CMOS","id":"现代科学级-cmos"},{"level":2,"text":"观测模式","id":"观测模式"},{"level":3,"text":"成像观测","id":"成像观测"},{"level":3,"text":"光谱观测","id":"光谱观测"},{"level":2,"text":"代表性设施","id":"代表性设施"},{"level":3,"text":"地面大型光学望远镜","id":"地面大型光学望远镜"},{"level":3,"text":"在建下一代极大望远镜","id":"在建下一代极大望远镜"},{"level":2,"text":"JWST 与空间光学观测","id":"jwst-与空间光学观测"},{"level":2,"text":"大规模巡天与数据驱动天文学","id":"大规模巡天与数据驱动天文学"},{"level":3,"text":"巡天范式的演进","id":"巡天范式的演进"},{"level":3,"text":"Vera C. Rubin 天文台与 LSST","id":"vera-c-rubin-天文台与-lsst"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿方向","id":"前沿方向"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"射电天文学：无线电波段的宇宙探测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/observational-astronomy/electromagnetic-spectrum/radio-astronomy"}}